  "target": "C1-LOG-UNAVOIDABLE: actual policy-independent binary law to same-path harmonic/log lower producer, including one fixed vector outside arbitrary bounded measurable causal seed integration. Orabona v10 printed p.4/PDF p.16 states that logarithmic dependence is unavoidable and explicitly gives no minimax-optimality proof there. H(T+1)/6 and log(T+2)/6 are derived quantitative support, neither printed nor claimed sharp. This is not a numbered source theorem. Only the required C1-LOG-UNAVOIDABLE source claim is supported by this new proof package. BODY review accepted with explicit delta; integrated root/Tests/harness, shared registry/site/pixels, FINAL review, native acceptance and PR remain separate gates. Chapter1 remains open:16 source items, mandatory proof total unknown(null), full regret/minimum, NoRegret and six existing main-relative contributor gaps remain required. Chapter2 is incomplete; Chapters3–16 are unenumerated and necessary appendix dependencies remain required. Total Goal ACTIVE. Exact stacked OPEN unmerged PR190 base9425fecb38be60b1acb7a918cb149f72117133ad; no main/live/merge/deployment claim.",
